Package: concordR
Title: Protein-Level Audit of Gene Lists Against an RNA to Protein Concordance Atlas
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Artur", "Shvetcov", role = c("aut", "cre"),
                  email = "shvetsov1983@gmail.com")
Description: Audits any gene list at the protein level against an integrated
    atlas of RNA to protein concordance spanning 488,190 observations across
    11,154 genes, 24 tissues, and 53 cell types. Given proteins nominated as
    drug targets or mechanisms from plasma, CSF, or another sample type,
    concordR scores each on four independent gates: whether RNA reliably
    predicts protein for that gene, whether the protein is detected in the
    tissue the claim is about, whether its subcellular localisation is
    consistent with the sample, and how tissue-specific its protein
    expression is. Gates are reported separately and combined by the user,
    or by the supplied accept/caution/decline and funnel functions.
